# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# ============================================================
# Rebuild typical_timeseries_fast.csv for current final model
#
# Purpose:
#   Rebuild the typical seasonal trajectory library used by Fig.5
#   while keeping the old algorithmic structure:
#     - city-year seasonal median trajectories
#     - grouped by Köppen major class
#     - summarize by mean, p10, p90
#     - 46 8-day steps
#
# Key fixes:
#   1) Use koppen_df before building, avoiding all-UNK grouping
#   2) Include LC so current model channel MODIS.LC is not filled as 0
#
# Output:
#   /content/drive/MyDrive/anature_revised/
#   typical_timeseries_fast_currentModel_withLC_koppen.csv
# ============================================================

